Read AGENTS.md at the repo root before making changes. It contains the pipeline
stage order, status mapping, gotchas, repo map, and workflow guides.

Quick reminders:
- Pipeline: extract → rewrite → describe → tag → localize → substitute → ready
- Tag runs on Spanish text BEFORE localize
- `describe` stage outputs `images_described` (not `described`)
- Use `pip install -e ".[dev]"` and `make test` after code changes
- Run `make format`, `make lint`, and `make check` before committing; `make setup` installs git hooks
- `mexipes review` is advisory: default 3 publications x 3 recipes, writes only to `data/reviews/`, and never auto-applies findings
- Never commit .env
